  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "認識甲骨文字與古代中國文化",
    "sub_ename": "ORACLE BONE SCRIPTS AND ANCIENT CHINESE CULTURE",
    "describe_ch": "本課程從考古、文物和文獻視角介紹商周時期甲骨文和金文的造字初義，內容含甲骨文基礎認識、商代考古、人鬼巫、人體、生老病死、商周青銅器、兵器戰爭、刑罰、大自然、動物、狩獵與農業、食衣、住行、育樂，和商業貨幣度量衡，另特別講述龍字與古代中國崇龍的起源與形成。本課程規畫中研院歷史文物陳列館校外教學，可自由參加。除上述，學員可對文字起源，古代氣候環境、文化、工藝、戰爭形態、藝術、宗教信仰等有更深入了解。",
    "describe_eh": "Chinese characters are significant intermediaries on peering the past society, for the ideas of creation largely coming from the living of past people and their cultural-historical process. The earliest-known Chinese characters come from the oracle bone scripts and bronze inscriptions of the middle to late Shang Dynasty. This course presents an introduction to some which have been successfully deciphered, with an emphasis on the ideas of character formation, evolution, and their connections to archaeological discoveries and historical records. Based on the characteristics of oracle bone scripts, several introductory themes are covered, together with some additional topics, as a brief introduction to the legendary, Shang Dynasty, ancient Chinese bronzes, and a special topic on Chinese dragon. This course provides students with a basic understanding of these topics in the context of early China, including environmental changes, cultural transformation, craftmanship, artistic representation, religious rituals, and so forth.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 2.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "認識中國古代文字的造字初義與歷史文化",
      "describe_en": "To acquire basic knowledge on the creation of ancient Chinese characters and the contextual development of history and culture."
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "藉由古代文物背後之文化脈絡瞭解探索文化創新",
      "describe_en": "To explore the potential capacity of cultural innovation through the understanding of cultural context behind ancient cultural relics."
    }
  ],
